const preserveLocalSchoolState=(base,local)=>{const next={...base};for(const key of ['schoolBuses','schoolBranches','schoolChildren','schoolParents','schoolScans','schoolRoutes','drivers','schoolAttenders','schoolCoordinators','schoolRfidCards','schoolRfidReaders'])if((local?.[key]||[]).length&&!(next[key]||[]).length)next[key]=local[key];if(local?.schoolSettings&&Object.keys(next.schoolSettings||{}).length===0)next.schoolSettings=local.schoolSettings;return next};

function SchoolBusCreateForm({company,vehicles,children,scans,store,setStore,setPage,onClose,toast}){
  const[vehicleId,setVehicleId]=useState('');
  const[now,setNow]=useState(()=>new Date());
  useEffect(()=>{const timer=window.setInterval(()=>setNow(new Date()),1000);return()=>window.clearInterval(timer)},[]);
  const bus=vehicles.find(v=>String(v.id)===String(vehicleId));
  const linkedChildren=children.filter(child=>String(child.vehicleId)===String(vehicleId));
  const linkedScans=scans.filter(scan=>String(scan.vehicleId||scan.busId)===String(vehicleId)||String(scan.vehicleName||'')===String(bus?.name||''));
  const childScans=child=>linkedScans.filter(scan=>String(scan.childId||'')===String(child.id)||String(scan.childName||'')===String(child.name||''));
  const lastEvent=(child,kind)=>childScans(child).filter(scan=>{const type=String(scan.eventType||'').toLowerCase();return kind==='exit'?/(exit|alight|drop|off)/.test(type):!/(exit|alight|drop|off)/.test(type)}).sort((a,b)=>new Date(b.scannedAt||b.createdAt||0)-new Date(a.scannedAt||a.createdAt||0))[0];
  const entryCount=bus?linkedChildren.filter(child=>lastEvent(child,'entry')).length:0;
  const exitCount=bus?linkedChildren.filter(child=>lastEvent(child,'exit')).length:0;
  const dateLabel=now.toLocaleDateString(undefined,{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}),timeLabel=now.toLocaleTimeString(undefined,{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit'});
  const submit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!bus)return;const row={companyId:company.id,vehicleId:Number(bus.id),vehicleName:bus.name,plateNumber:bus.plate||'',childCount:linkedChildren.length,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};const existing=(store.schoolBuses||[]).find(item=>String(item.companyId)===String(company.id)&&String(item.vehicleId)===String(bus.id));const next=existing?updateRow(store,'schoolBuses',existing.id,row):addRow(store,'schoolBuses',row);if(!await setStore(next))return;toast(`Bus saved on this PC: ${bus.name}`);onClose()};
  return <form onSubmit={submit} className="schoolBusCreateForm"><div className="schoolBusSelectorBlock"><Field label="Vehicle / bus *" wide><select required autoFocus value={vehicleId} onChange={e=>setVehicleId(e.target.value)}><option value="">Choose a vehicle</option>{vehicles.map(v=><option key={v.id} value={v.id}>{v.name}{v.plate?` · ${v.plate}`:''} · ID {v.id}</option>)}</select></Field><p>Select one vehicle to see the children assigned to this bus.</p></div>{bus&&<div className="schoolBusOverview"><div className="schoolBusOverviewHead"><div><span className="schoolBusEyebrow">Tracked bus</span><h3>{bus.name}</h3><small>{bus.plate||'No plate'} · Vehicle ID {bus.id}</small></div></div><div className="schoolBusMetrics" aria-label="Bus tracking summary"><div><b>{linkedChildren.length}</b><span>Total children</span></div><div><b>{entryCount}</b><span>Entry count</span></div><div><b>{exitCount}</b><span>Exit count</span></div><div><b>{dateLabel}</b><span>Date</span></div><div><b>{timeLabel}</b><span>Time</span></div></div><div className="schoolBusChildren">{linkedChildren.length?linkedChildren.map(child=>{const entry=lastEvent(child,'entry'),exit=lastEvent(child,'exit');return <article className="schoolBusChildRow" key={child.id}><div className="schoolBusChildIdentity"><b>{child.name}</b><small>{child.grade||child.className||'Student'}{child.rfidIdentifier?` · RFID ${child.rfidIdentifier}`:''}</small></div><div className="schoolBusEvent"><span className="schoolBusEventLabel entry">Entry</span><b>{entry?.scannedAt?new Date(entry.scannedAt).toLocaleString():'No entry yet'}</b></div><div className="schoolBusEvent"><span className="schoolBusEventLabel exit">Exit</span><b>{exit?.scannedAt?new Date(exit.scannedAt).toLocaleString():'No exit yet'}</b></div></article>}) : <Empty text="No children are assigned to this vehicle yet."/>}</div></div>}<div className="modalActions"><button type="button" onClick={onClose}>Cancel</button><button type="button" className="schoolMapButton" disabled={!bus} onClick={()=>{if(bus){localStorage.setItem('inviha.schoolMapVehicleId',String(bus.id));setPage('map')}}}><MapIcon/>Open route map</button><button className="primary" disabled={!bus}><Save/>Save bus tracking</button></div></form>
}

